{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Travel",
    "description": "Travel insurance: compare quote, then full quote.",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/igw/travel/compare-quote/init": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "1.1 Init Compare Quote",
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted - 202",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Accepted",
                  "data": {
                    "ClientRequestId": "870be517-a145-4a25-b8b1-0447513291f4",
                    "Channel": "870be517-a145-4a25-b8b1-0447513291f4",
                    "Events": {
                      "ready": "insurance.plan.received",
                      "failed": "insurance.plan.failed"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Rejected at init - 422",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "Travel compare quote requires a main insured traveller."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Starts a comparison and returns immediately (202) with a ClientRequestId.\n\nWEBSOCKET (do this next):\n1. Subscribe to the PUBLIC channel named ClientRequestId (Echo: echo.channel(id)).\n2. Listen for '.insurance.plan.received' (ready -> run 1.2) and '.insurance.plan.failed' (payload {client_request_id, code, message}). Note the leading dot.\n3. Safety net: also GET the result once right after subscribing and every ~3s (event can fire before you subscribe).\n\nClientRequestId is the id for the whole flow: the channel, the result GET, and Full Quote.\nA comparison the insurer rejects fails HERE (422 etc.), not later as an event.\n\nTest it by hand: npx wscat -c \"wss://stage-api.oneinsurance.shop/app/<REVERB_APP_KEY>?protocol=7\" then send {\"event\":\"pusher:subscribe\",\"data\":{\"channel\":\"<ClientRequestId>\"}}",
        "operationId": "11_Init_Compare_Quote",
        "tags": [
          "1. Compare Quote"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "example": {
                "ProductCode": "TRAVEL",
                "ProductVersion": "1.0",
                "EffectiveDate": "2026-12-01",
                "ExpiryDate": "2026-12-08",
                "TripType": "SINGLE",
                "TravelType": "INDIVIDUAL",
                "NoOfTravellers": 1,
                "BranchCode": "HO",
                "Age": 34,
                "LGT": 0.75,
                "PromoCodeList": [],
                "TravelDetailList": [
                  {
                    "TravelCoverageArea": "WORLD",
                    "PlaceOfOrgin": "PH",
                    "TravelCountry": "JP",
                    "DisplaySequence": 1
                  }
                ],
                "PolicyCustomerList": [
                  {
                    "DateOfBirth": "1990-03-01"
                  }
                ],
                "PolicyLobList": [
                  {
                    "ProductCode": "TRAVEL",
                    "PolicyRiskList": [
                      {
                        "ProductElementCode": "R00001",
                        "IsMainInsured": "Y",
                        "DateOfBirth": "1990-03-01",
                        "IsAdultTraveller": "Y",
                        "FirstName": "Ram",
                        "LastName": "Kumar",
                        "Gender": "M"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "AgentCode": "2BCUMAXGAV",
                "Slug": "ifrc"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/igw/travel/compare-quote/b85b6ff5-0441-4e0c-81c0-69005cbd36f4": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "1.2 Get Compare Quote Result",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Ready - 200",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Successful",
                  "data": [
                    {
                      "insurer": {
                        "name": "Malayan Insurance",
                        "logo_url": "https://stage-ifrc-igw.oneinsurance.shop/storage/insurer-logos/malayan.png",
                        "code": "MIC"
                      },
                      "product": {
                        "code": "MIC-TRAVEL-MASTER",
                        "name": "Travel Master"
                      },
                      "plan": {
                        "code": "TMPHPC2",
                        "name": "TM CSL ASIAN W/ COVID 500K",
                        "sum_insured": "500000.00"
                      },
                      "zone": {
                        "code": "ASIAN",
                        "name": "Asian"
                      },
                      "premium": {
                        "amount": "258.00",
                        "currency": "PHP"
                      },
                      "coverages": [
                        {
                          "category": "Personal Accident Insurance",
                          "name": "Accidental Death, Dismemberment and Disablement",
                          "is_optional": false,
                          "addon_code": null,
                          "limit": {
                            "type": "amount",
                            "amount": "1000000.00",
                            "sub_limit_amount": null,
                            "sub_limit_per": null,
                            "per_unit": null,
                            "per_unit_size": null,
                            "max_units": null,
                            "waiting_period_hours": null,
                            "notes": null
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "202": {
            "description": "Pending - 202",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Pending",
                  "data": {
                    "status": "pending"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown or expired id - 404",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "Compare quote request not found or expired."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "410": {
            "description": "Expired at insurer - 410",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "Travel compare quote expired. Submit a new request."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Fetch the comparison cards. Call it when '.insurance.plan.received' arrives (or poll every ~3s as a fallback).\n\n200 = ready, data is the list of cards\n202 = still running (Retry-After: 2)\n404 = unknown/expired id (kept 1 hour)\n410 = expired at the insurer, search again\n504 = timed out, search again\n\nOn 200 this collection saves the FIRST card's insurer/product/plan codes into variables so 2.1 works. In your app, use the card the user picks.",
        "operationId": "12_Get_Compare_Quote_Result",
        "tags": [
          "1. Compare Quote"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/igw/travel/full-quote": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "2.1 Full Quote",
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created - 201",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Successful",
                  "data": {
                    "id": "b1f0c2d4-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
                    "proposal_number": "MIC-2026-0001",
                    "status": "draft",
                    "insurer": {
                      "code": "MIC",
                      "name": "Malayan Insurance"
                    },
                    "product": {
                      "code": "MIC-TRAVEL-MASTER",
                      "name": "Travel Master"
                    },
                    "plan": {
                      "code": "TMPHPC2",
                      "name": "TM CSL ASIAN W/ COVID 500K"
                    },
                    "premium": {
                      "amount": "258.00",
                      "currency": "PHP"
                    },
                    "travellers": [
                      {
                        "is_principal_applicant": true,
                        "first_name": "Ram",
                        "last_name": "Kumar",
                        "date_of_birth": "1990-03-01"
                      }
                    ],
                    "expires_at": "2026-10-14T00:00:00Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Request still in flight - 409",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "A request with this Idempotency-Key is already being processed."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Comparison not ready or expired - 422",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "No ready comparison result was found with that id.",
                  "errors": {
                    "quote_comparison_request_id": [
                      "No ready comparison result was found with that id."
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Gateway failure - 502",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "message": "Travel full quote failed."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Create the quote for the picked plan. Run 1.1 and 1.2 first (this uses the saved variables).\n\nFIELDS\n- ClientRequestId: the id from 1.1 (same one used for the websocket and the GET)\n- AgentCode: the selling agent\n- insurer_code / product_code / plan_code: from the picked card (card.insurer.code, card.product.code, card.plan.code)\n- travellers[]: count must equal NoOfTravellers from 1.1; exactly one is_principal_applicant=true\n- CustomField (this API only, not sent to the insurer): PlanName, TravellerLists, IdImages (multipart)\n\nVALIDATION happens at the insurer gateway, not in this API. id_type values and address.country codes must be ones the gateway accepts (ask backend for the list; 'PAS' is only an example).\n\nErrors: 422 + errors{} (keys like 'travellers.0.id_number' contain dots - use bracket access), 422 on quote_comparison_request_id (comparison not ready/expired -> compare again), 409 (same Idempotency-Key still in flight), 502 (insurer/gateway failure).\n\nRETRY: enable Idempotency-Key and reuse the same value, or resend an identical body; either returns the original quote instead of creating a second one.\n\nID IMAGES: switch the body to form-data, send fields as travellers[0][first_name] ... and add CustomField[IdImages][0][file_name|front_id|back_id]. In form-data send booleans as 1/0 (not 'true').",
        "operationId": "21_Full_Quote",
        "tags": [
          "2. Full Quote"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "example": {
                "ClientRequestId": "<<client_request_id>>",
                "AgentCode": "<<agent_code>>",
                "insurer_code": "<<insurer_code>>",
                "product_code": "<<product_code>>",
                "plan_code": "<<plan_code>>",
                "travellers": [
                  {
                    "is_principal_applicant": true,
                    "first_name": "Ram",
                    "middle_name": "K",
                    "last_name": "Kumar",
                    "suffix": null,
                    "date_of_birth": "1990-03-01",
                    "gender": "male",
                    "id_type": "PAS",
                    "id_number": "L8976M98",
                    "address": {
                      "line1": "KKK",
                      "line2": "Manila",
                      "city": "Manila",
                      "province": "Metro Manila",
                      "postal_code": "2922",
                      "country": "PH"
                    },
                    "email": "xyz@gmail.com",
                    "mobile": "9898765467"
                  }
                ],
                "CustomField": {
                  "PlanName": "<<plan_name>>",
                  "TravellerLists": []
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "<<base_url>>"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "1. Compare Quote",
      "description": "Asynchronous: init, wait for the websocket event, then fetch the cards."
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Full Quote",
      "description": "Create the quote for the picked plan."
    }
  ],
  "x-hoppscotch-folder-tags": "slash"
}